===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Black & White|Maractus|11}} from the {{TCG|Black & White}} expansion.
*'''Sting''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Koga's Weedle|82}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

